---
import Layout from '../../layouts/MoodReactions.astro';
import { MR } from '../../data/moodReactions';
---

<Layout
  title="Refund Policy · Mood Reactions"
  description={`${MR.refundBadge} money-back guarantee for Mood Reactions licenses.`}
  canonical="/mood-reactions/refund"
>
  <article class="mr-prose">
    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {MR.lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>{MR.refundBadge} money-back guarantee.</strong> If Mood Reactions isn't for you, email us within
      {MR.refundWindow} of being charged and you'll get a full refund. No questions asked.
    </div>

    <h2>When you can get a refund</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>First purchase:</strong> full refund if you ask within {MR.refundWindow} of buying.</li>
      <li><strong>Yearly renewal:</strong> full refund if you ask within {MR.refundWindow} of the renewal charge, in case you forgot to cancel.</li>
      <li>After {MR.refundWindow}, payments aren't refundable, but you can cancel any time so you won't be charged again.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to ask</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href={`mailto:${MR.supportEmail}?subject=Mood%20Reactions%20refund`}>{MR.supportEmail}</a> from the address you
      bought with, or include that address and your order ID from the receipt. That's it; you don't need to give a reason.
    </p>

    <h2>What happens next</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We process refund requests within 2 business days.</li>
      <li>The money goes back to your original payment method through Dodo Payments, our merchant of record. Banks usually show it within 5 to 10 business days.</li>
      <li>Your subscription is cancelled and your license key stops working, usually within 24 hours.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cancelling without a refund</h2>
    <p>
      If you just want to stop renewing, cancel from the link in your receipt or by email. Your license keeps working
      until the end of the year you paid for. See the <a href="/mood-reactions/terms">Terms</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Problems before refunds</h2>
    <p>
      If something isn't working, a site that doesn't trigger or a GIF that won't load, write to us first. We're often
      able to fix it. The refund is still there if we can't.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><a href={`mailto:${MR.supportEmail}`}>{MR.supportEmail}</a></p>
  </article>
</Layout>
